{"seq":2,"slug":"experiment-culture","title":"实验文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/experiment-culture","wordCount":1860,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"实验文化\">实验文化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>实验文化（Experimentation Culture）是指组织在产品决策中系统性地采用数据驱动实验的理念、流程和行为准则。技术上搭建一个实验平台只是起点，真正的挑战在于让实验成为组织决策的默认方式。Netflix、Google、Microsoft、Booking.com 等公司的经验表明，实验文化的成熟度直接决定了实验平台的投资回报率。一个拥有优秀实验文化的组织，即使实验平台技术简单，也能持续产出高质量的数据驱动决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[实验文化成熟度模型] --&gt; B[Level 1: 临时实验]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Level 2: 流程化实验]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Level 3: 民主化实验]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Level 4: 数据驱动决策]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[少数团队偶尔做实验]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[专门团队支持实验]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[任何人都能创建实验]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[默认实验发布一切变更]\">graph TD\n    A[实验文化成熟度模型] --&gt; B[Level 1: 临时实验]\n    A --&gt; C[Level 2: 流程化实验]\n    A --&gt; D[Level 3: 民主化实验]\n    A --&gt; E[Level 4: 数据驱动决策]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[少数团队偶尔做实验]\n    C --&gt; C1[专门团队支持实验]\n    D --&gt; D1[任何人都能创建实验]\n    E --&gt; E1[默认实验发布一切变更]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成熟度等级</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>实验频率</th>\n<th>典型组织</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Level 1</td>\n<td>临时性、个别团队</td>\n<td>每月几个</td>\n<td>初创公司早期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 2</td>\n<td>有平台、专人支持</td>\n<td>每周几十个</td>\n<td>中型科技公司</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 3</td>\n<td>自助式、全员参与</td>\n<td>每天数百个</td>\n<td>大型科技公司</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 4</td>\n<td>默认实验、自动化决策</td>\n<td>并发数千个</td>\n<td>Google/Microsoft/Netflix</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实验驱动的决策框架\">实验驱动的决策框架</h2><p>将实验融入产品开发流程需要建立清晰的决策框架，明确什么情况下必须做实验、实验的优先级如何确定、以及实验结果如何转化为产品决策。</p>\n<p><strong>实验必要性评估</strong>：并非所有变更都需要实验。修复明确的 Bug、合规性变更、基础设施升级通常不需要实验。但涉及用户体验、业务指标、算法策略的变更都应通过实验验证。关键原则是：如果一个变更的效果不确定，且回滚成本高或影响范围大，就应该做实验。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from enum import Enum&#10;from dataclasses import dataclass&#10;&#10;class ExperimentPriority(Enum):&#10;    P0_CRITICAL = &quot;must_experiment&quot;&#10;    P1_HIGH = &quot;should_experiment&quot;&#10;    P2_MEDIUM = &quot;recommended&quot;&#10;    P3_LOW = &quot;optional&quot;&#10;&#10;class ChangeType(Enum):&#10;    ALGORITHM = &quot;algorithm&quot;&#10;    UI_UX = &quot;ui_ux&quot;&#10;    PRICING = &quot;pricing&quot;&#10;    INFRASTRUCTURE = &quot;infrastructure&quot;&#10;    BUG_FIX = &quot;bug_fix&quot;&#10;    COMPLIANCE = &quot;compliance&quot;&#10;&#10;@dataclass&#10;class ExperimentDecision:&#10;    change_type: ChangeType&#10;    user_impact: str&#10;    revenue_impact: bool&#10;    reversible: bool&#10;&#10;    def assess_priority(self):&#10;        if self.change_type == ChangeType.BUG_FIX:&#10;            return ExperimentPriority.P3_LOW&#10;        if self.change_type == ChangeType.COMPLIANCE:&#10;            return ExperimentPriority.P3_LOW&#10;        if self.revenue_impact:&#10;            return ExperimentPriority.P0_CRITICAL&#10;        if self.change_type in (ChangeType.ALGORITHM, ChangeType.PRICING):&#10;            return ExperimentPriority.P0_CRITICAL&#10;        if self.change_type == ChangeType.UI_UX and self.user_impact == &quot;high&quot;:&#10;            return ExperimentPriority.P1_HIGH&#10;        return ExperimentPriority.P2_MEDIUM&#10;&#10;decision = ExperimentDecision(&#10;    change_type=ChangeType.ALGORITHM,&#10;    user_impact=&quot;high&quot;,&#10;    revenue_impact=True,&#10;    reversible=True&#10;)&#10;print(f&quot;Priority: {decision.assess_priority().value}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> enum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Enum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclasses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExperimentPriority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    P0_CRITICAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"must_experiment\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    P1_HIGH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"should_experiment\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    P2_MEDIUM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"recommended\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    P3_LOW</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"optional\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChangeType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ALGORITHM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"algorithm\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    UI_UX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ui_ux\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    PRICING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"pricing\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    INFRASTRUCTURE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"infrastructure\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    BUG_FIX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"bug_fix\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COMPLIANCE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"compliance\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExperimentDecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    change_type: ChangeType</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_impact: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    revenue_impact: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reversible: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> assess_priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.change_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ChangeType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">BUG_FIX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ExperimentPriority.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">P3_LOW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.change_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ChangeType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COMPLIANCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ExperimentPriority.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">P3_LOW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.revenue_impact:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ExperimentPriority.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">P0_CRITICAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.change_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ChangeType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ALGORITHM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ChangeType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">PRICING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ExperimentPriority.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">P0_CRITICAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.change_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ChangeType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">UI_UX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.user_impact </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ExperimentPriority.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">P1_HIGH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ExperimentPriority.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">P2_MEDIUM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ExperimentDecision(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    change_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ChangeType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ALGORITHM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    user_impact</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    revenue_impact</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    reversible</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Priority: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">decision.assess_priority().value</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>假设驱动的实验设计</strong>：每个实验应始于一个清晰的假设，而非&quot;看看会发生什么&quot;。假设应包含：改变什么（自变量）、预期影响什么指标（因变量）、预期方向和幅度（效应量预估）、以及为什么会有这个效应（因果机制假说）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>假设组成</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自变量</td>\n<td>实验改变的因素</td>\n<td>将搜索结果排序从 BM25 切换为语义排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因变量</td>\n<td>预期受影响的指标</td>\n<td>搜索点击率、购买转化率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效应方向</td>\n<td>预期的变化方向</td>\n<td>点击率提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效应量</td>\n<td>预期的变化幅度</td>\n<td>提升 2-5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果机制</td>\n<td>为什么会有这个效应</td>\n<td>语义排序更好地理解用户意图，减少无关结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险评估</td>\n<td>可能的负面影响</td>\n<td>长尾查询可能退化，需要监控覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实验审查与质量控制\">实验审查与质量控制</h2><p>实验的质量不仅取决于统计方法，还取决于实验设计和执行过程的严谨性。建立实验审查制度（Experiment Review）是防止低质量实验浪费资源和产出误导性结论的关键。</p>\n<p><strong>实验前审查清单</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@dataclass&#10;class ExperimentReviewChecklist:&#10;    hypothesis_clear: bool = False&#10;    metrics_predefined: bool = False&#10;    sample_size_calculated: bool = False&#10;    guardrails_set: bool = False&#10;    mde_justified: bool = False&#10;    duration_planned: bool = False&#10;    rollback_plan: bool = False&#10;    no_concurrent_conflicts: bool = False&#10;&#10;    @property&#10;    def approval_score(self):&#10;        items = [&#10;            self.hypothesis_clear,&#10;            self.metrics_predefined,&#10;            self.sample_size_calculated,&#10;            self.guardrails_set,&#10;            self.mde_justified,&#10;            self.duration_planned,&#10;            self.rollback_plan,&#10;            self.no_concurrent_conflicts,&#10;        ]&#10;        return sum(items) / len(items)&#10;&#10;    @property&#10;    def can_launch(self):&#10;        critical = [&#10;            self.hypothesis_clear,&#10;            self.metrics_predefined,&#10;            self.guardrails_set,&#10;            self.rollback_plan,&#10;        ]&#10;        return all(critical) and self.approval_score &gt;= 0.75&#10;&#10;checklist = ExperimentReviewChecklist(&#10;    hypothesis_clear=True, metrics_predefined=True,&#10;    sample_size_calculated=True, guardrails_set=True,&#10;    mde_justified=True, duration_planned=True,&#10;    rollback_plan=True, no_concurrent_conflicts=False,&#10;)&#10;print(f&quot;Score: {checklist.approval_score:.0%}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;Can launch: {checklist.can_launch}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExperimentReviewChecklist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hypothesis_clear: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metrics_predefined: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sample_size_calculated: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    guardrails_set: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mde_justified: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    duration_planned: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rollback_plan: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    no_concurrent_conflicts: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">property</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> approval_score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.hypothesis_clear,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.metrics_predefined,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sample_size_calculated,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.guardrails_set,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mde_justified,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.duration_planned,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.rollback_plan,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.no_concurrent_conflicts,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">property</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> can_launch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        critical </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.hypothesis_clear,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.metrics_predefined,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.guardrails_set,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.rollback_plan,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(critical) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.approval_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.75</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">checklist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ExperimentReviewChecklist(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    hypothesis_clear</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metrics_predefined</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    sample_size_calculated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">guardrails_set</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    mde_justified</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">duration_planned</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    rollback_plan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">no_concurrent_conflicts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Score: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">checklist.approval_score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.0%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Can launch: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">checklist.can_launch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>实验后复盘</strong>（Post-Experiment Review）同样重要。每个实验结束后应回答：实验是否验证了假设？效应量是否符合预期？是否发现了意外的指标变动？学到了什么可以指导未来的实验？</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>审查阶段</th>\n<th>关键问题</th>\n<th>负责人</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实验前</td>\n<td>假设是否清晰？指标是否预定义？</td>\n<td>实验发起人 + 统计审查员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验中</td>\n<td>护栏指标是否正常？SRM 是否通过？</td>\n<td>自动化监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验后</td>\n<td>效应是否符合预期？有何意外发现？</td>\n<td>实验发起人 + 团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期跟踪</td>\n<td>全量发布后效果是否持续？</td>\n<td>数据团队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"组织能力建设\">组织能力建设</h2><p>建立实验文化需要在组织层面进行系统性的能力建设，包括培训体系、知识管理和激励机制。</p>\n<p><strong>培训层次化</strong>：不同角色需要不同深度的实验知识。产品经理需要理解假设检验的基本概念和实验设计原则；工程师需要掌握 SDK 集成和数据管道；数据科学家需要精通统计方法和高级实验设计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 培训体系&#10;        A[入门课] --&gt; B[进阶课]&#10;        B --&gt; C[专家课]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    A --&gt; A1[PM: 实验设计基础]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[Eng: SDK 集成]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[PM: 高级实验设计]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[DS: 统计方法深入]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[DS: 因果推断与网络效应]\">graph LR\n    subgraph 培训体系\n        A[入门课] --&gt; B[进阶课]\n        B --&gt; C[专家课]\n    end\n\n    A --&gt; A1[PM: 实验设计基础]\n    A --&gt; A2[Eng: SDK 集成]\n    B --&gt; B1[PM: 高级实验设计]\n    B --&gt; B2[DS: 统计方法深入]\n    C --&gt; C1[DS: 因果推断与网络效应]</pre><p><strong>实验知识库</strong>：将历史实验结果和学习沉淀为组织知识。关键要素包括：实验假设和结论的结构化记录、跨团队的实验结果搜索、&quot;反直觉&quot;发现的高亮和传播、以及实验模式的总结（哪类变更通常有效/无效）。</p>\n<p><strong>激励机制设计</strong>：避免只奖励&quot;成功&quot;的实验（指标显著提升）。一个严谨但结果为&quot;无效&quot;的实验同样有价值——它避免了无效功能的全量上线。推荐的激励框架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>激励维度</th>\n<th>正向行为</th>\n<th>反向行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实验数量</td>\n<td>鼓励更多假设验证</td>\n<td>避免为凑数量做低价值实验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验质量</td>\n<td>严谨的设计和分析</td>\n<td>避免事后改指标、延长实验挖数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识分享</td>\n<td>主动分享实验洞察</td>\n<td>避免信息孤岛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策一致性</td>\n<td>按实验结果做决策</td>\n<td>避免忽视负面结果强行上线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"常见反模式与应对\">常见反模式与应对</h2><p>在实验文化建设过程中，常见的反模式可能比没有实验文化更有害——因为它们给出虚假的&quot;数据驱动&quot;外表。</p>\n<p><strong>HiPPO（Highest Paid Person&#39;s Opinion）</strong>：最高级别决策者的意见覆盖实验结果。当实验结果与领导直觉矛盾时，选择忽视数据。应对方法：建立预注册制度，在实验开始前就确定决策规则。</p>\n<p><strong>p-hacking 与数据钻探</strong>：不断尝试不同的指标定义、用户分段、时间窗口，直到找到&quot;显著&quot;结果。应对方法：预注册主要指标，对辅助指标使用多重校正，分析代码版本化。</p>\n<p><strong>实验延迟综合症</strong>：实验周期过长，新功能等待数月才能上线。根因通常是样本量计算过于保守或未使用方差缩减技术。应对方法：使用 CUPED、分层分析，采用贝叶斯方法支持灵活停止。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>危害</th>\n<th>应对策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HiPPO</td>\n<td>领导推翻实验结论</td>\n<td>实验投资浪费</td>\n<td>预注册 + 透明决策记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>p-hacking</td>\n<td>反复分析直到显著</td>\n<td>假发现率飙升</td>\n<td>预注册指标 + 多重校正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续观望</td>\n<td>结果不显著就延长实验</td>\n<td>膨胀 I 类错误</td>\n<td>序贯检验 + 固定停止规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽视护栏</td>\n<td>只看主指标不看负面</td>\n<td>用户体验退化</td>\n<td>自动护栏告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验延迟</td>\n<td>几个月才能做完一个实验</td>\n<td>迭代速度下降</td>\n<td>CUPED + 贝叶斯灵活停止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚荣指标</td>\n<td>选择容易显著的指标</td>\n<td>决策质量低</td>\n<td>北极星指标绑定业务目标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>实验文化是比实验平台更重要的竞争力，它决定了技术投资能否转化为决策质量的提升</li>\n<li>实验成熟度从 Level 1（临时实验）到 Level 4（默认实验发布一切），需要系统性建设</li>\n<li>假设驱动的实验设计包含自变量、因变量、预期效应量和因果机制，避免&quot;看看会怎样&quot;</li>\n<li>实验审查制度（前审、中监、后复盘）是保证实验质量的关键流程</li>\n<li>培训体系应分层设计，匹配不同角色的知识深度需求</li>\n<li>常见反模式（HiPPO、p-hacking、实验延迟）比没有实验更有害，需要制度性防范</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实验文化","id":"实验文化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实验驱动的决策框架","id":"实验驱动的决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"实验审查与质量控制","id":"实验审查与质量控制"},{"level":2,"text":"组织能力建设","id":"组织能力建设"},{"level":2,"text":"常见反模式与应对","id":"常见反模式与应对"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实验平台架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/experimentation-platform"},"next":{"title":"常见陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/common-pitfalls"}}